                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Like a supermarket's own brand version of Rez. A Bland and tasteless yawnfest. \nTo be fair I only played the tutorial and the first level once then uninstalled. But that goes to show how slow and boring it is compared to Rez or Child of Eden. \nStaying in one place, not moving but spinning around to see the attackers just doesn't work for this type of game. Not really bothered if it gets better because the start is such a chore.",
